pps/3476500/extras/7da2ab0de1ae90333b49c7dc3d35e028.poster.avif?t=1753069874\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476500/extras/7da2ab0de1ae90333b49c7dc3d35e028.webm?t=1753069874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3476500/extras/7da2ab0de1ae90333b49c7dc3d35e028.mp4?t=1753069874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
